WEBVTT

00:08.740 --> 00:15.340
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.340 --> 00:18.680
<b>I just reached my hand out
like a daredevil</b>

00:18.680 --> 00:21.980
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:21.980 --> 00:27.440
<b>No matter what I get, I won't
ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.620 --> 00:34.560
<b>Escape from the gaps in
your tangled up heart</b>

00:34.560 --> 00:36.630
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.630 --> 00:41.870
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.870 --> 00:44.910
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:48.180
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.180 --> 00:51.810
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.810 --> 00:55.410
<b>Right away</b>

01:05.990 --> 01:08.030
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.030 --> 01:13.270
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.270 --> 01:16.370
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.370 --> 01:19.610
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.610 --> 01:23.180
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.180 --> 01:25.840
<b>Right away</b>

02:04.920 --> 02:06.890
<b>Sanzo, you got a light?</b>

02:10.130 --> 02:11.590
<b>Thank you.</b>

02:13.800 --> 02:14.560
<b>Hey!</b>

02:14.560 --> 02:15.300
<b>What?
Hey!</b>

02:15.300 --> 02:16.060
<b>What?
It's not lighting up!</b>

02:16.060 --> 02:16.930
<b>It's not lighting up!</b>

02:16.930 --> 02:19.600
<b>Yeah, the flint's gone.</b>

02:19.600 --> 02:23.240
<b>What?! Then it was useless
to begin with!</b>

02:23.240 --> 02:25.210
<b>That's why I lent it to you.</b>

02:25.210 --> 02:27.510
<b>You trying to pick a fight here?!</b>

02:27.510 --> 02:31.510
<b>Now, now, once we get going, we'll
stop by a store somewhere.</b>

02:31.510 --> 02:35.220
<b>Then hurry up and kick Hakuryu
out of bed so we can get going.</b>

02:35.220 --> 02:36.950
<b>That wouldn't be nice!</b>

02:36.950 --> 02:38.850
<b>Hakuryu's tired too.</b>

02:43.360 --> 02:45.380
<b>Damn it, he's sleeping so soundly!</b>

02:51.170 --> 02:52.630
<b>Oh, a shooting star.</b>

03:37.280 --> 03:38.680
<b>Is everyone okay?!</b>

03:38.680 --> 03:40.150
<b>Yeah, just barely...</b>

03:42.450 --> 03:43.920
<b>What's that?</b>

03:51.890 --> 03:53.330
<b>They're scared senseless.</b>

03:53.330 --> 03:54.800
<b>It doesn't matter.</b>

03:58.630 --> 04:00.530
<b>Hey, I've got a question for you guys.</b>

04:02.600 --> 04:05.300
<b>Have you seen a group of
four men around here?</b>

04:08.140 --> 04:10.110
<b>I see. Sorry to have bothered you.</b>

04:26.330 --> 04:27.890
<b>What a futile act.</b>

04:28.800 --> 04:32.870
<b>Compared to the numbers
we'll be killing from now on,</b>

04:32.870 --> 04:35.100
<b>it's not even worth the mention, right?</b>

04:43.240 --> 04:44.580
<b>Damn it!</b>

04:44.580 --> 04:46.310
<b>Who the hell were they?!</b>

04:47.050 --> 04:50.680
<b>I doubt they realized
who we are, but...</b>

04:55.490 --> 04:58.820
<b>Man, I don't feel like I really ate.</b>

05:00.800 --> 05:04.930
<b>You should be grateful we even
found a place open so late.</b>

05:04.930 --> 05:07.540
<b>Grateful? I can't believe you said that.</b>

05:07.540 --> 05:09.440
<b>If you're done eating, let's go.</b>

05:09.440 --> 05:12.570
<b>No need for us to hang around
a restaurant like this.</b>

05:12.570 --> 05:15.380
<b>A restaurant like this? How nice
of you to put it that way.</b>

05:15.380 --> 05:17.570
<b>It can't be helped. It's the truth.</b>

05:19.280 --> 05:21.480
<b>What the heck? They're all together?</b>

05:21.480 --> 05:22.950
<b>Looks like it.</b>

05:25.120 --> 05:27.390
<b>Good grief.</b>

05:27.390 --> 05:30.990
<b>Just what the hell is wrong
with my restaurant?!</b>

05:30.990 --> 05:34.500
<b>Let's see, if I had to say,
it's the smell.</b>

05:34.500 --> 05:35.760
<b>Smell?</b>

05:35.760 --> 05:38.900
<b>You guys all stink.</b>

05:38.900 --> 05:40.830
<b>Don't mess with us, you bastard!</b>

05:59.490 --> 06:00.950
<b>These two...</b>

06:02.590 --> 06:04.530
<b>Gimme the strongest you've got.</b>

06:04.530 --> 06:05.790
<b>Oolong tea.</b>

06:05.790 --> 06:07.300
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

06:07.300 --> 06:08.560
<b>They're here.</b>

06:08.560 --> 06:10.030
<b>That seems to be the case.</b>

06:15.370 --> 06:18.030
<b>Sorry, but would you lend me a light?</b>

06:19.240 --> 06:20.830
<b>Yeah, sure.</b>

06:25.280 --> 06:27.250
<b>Thank you.</b>

06:27.250 --> 06:30.250
<b>Well, that takes care of
the after-dinner smoke.</b>

06:30.250 --> 06:32.410
<b>Let's go, Sanzo.</b>

06:33.250 --> 06:34.890
<b>Not so fast!</b>

06:34.890 --> 06:36.960
<b>How much is it?</b>

06:36.960 --> 06:40.560
<b>I'll pay for the food, even
if it tasted like crap.</b>

06:40.560 --> 06:41.730
<b>You should be grateful.</b>

06:41.730 --> 06:42.060
<b>Shuddup! You ain't getting
out of here alive!
You should be grateful.</b>

06:42.060 --> 06:45.500
<b>Shuddup! You ain't getting
out of here alive!</b>

06:47.200 --> 06:49.930
<b>What is this, a rip-off joint?</b>

06:50.940 --> 06:54.780
<b>Isn't it a bit expensive to ask
for their lives as payment?</b>

06:54.780 --> 06:56.980
<b>You got nothing to do with this!
Stay out of it!</b>

06:56.980 --> 06:59.280
<b>We've got nothing to do with this?
Oh, really?</b>

06:59.280 --> 07:00.770
<b>We're customers here too.</b>

07:01.820 --> 07:05.590
<b>Besides, I don't like the stink
of demons either.</b>

07:05.590 --> 07:07.050
<b>Who the hell are you guys?!</b>

07:12.030 --> 07:13.550
<b>We're gods.</b>

07:14.430 --> 07:15.930
<b>Gods?</b>

07:15.930 --> 07:17.360
<b>You heard him.</b>

07:20.140 --> 07:21.300
<b>Gods, he says!</b>

07:21.300 --> 07:21.640
<b>Is this guy right in the head?
Gods, he says!</b>

07:21.640 --> 07:22.840
<b>Is this guy right in the head?</b>

07:22.840 --> 07:24.570
<b>You better keep the jokes
to a minimum.</b>

07:25.140 --> 07:29.410
<b>Your face looks more like
a joke to me.</b>

07:31.380 --> 07:34.350
<b>Goku, it's rude to laugh at that.</b>

07:35.420 --> 07:38.180
<b>No wonder there aren't any women
among the customers.</b>

07:38.990 --> 07:40.350
<b>I don't like them.</b>

07:41.620 --> 07:42.890
<b>Sanzo?</b>

07:42.890 --> 07:44.520
<b>You ain't getting away with that!</b>

07:52.430 --> 07:55.200
<b>Damn you, you bastard!</b>

07:55.800 --> 07:59.070
<b>Hey, you look more
handsome that way!</b>

08:02.640 --> 08:04.200
<b>Bastard! I'll kill you!</b>

08:05.580 --> 08:07.240
<b>You were going to do that from
the start, weren't you?</b>

08:09.420 --> 08:13.550
<b>I'll tell you ahead of time. I hate
demons from the bottom of my heart!</b>

08:15.890 --> 08:20.590
<b>No matter what the guy's like, it just
makes me want to kill him!</b>

08:22.830 --> 08:24.400
<b>What the hell is he?</b>

08:24.400 --> 08:28.200
<b>At least, he's not a demon.
That's for certain.</b>

08:29.400 --> 08:31.770
<b>Maybe he really is a god, right?</b>

08:34.680 --> 08:36.470
<b>One more cup.</b>

08:37.250 --> 08:39.950
<b>One more cup, please.</b>

08:39.950 --> 08:41.250
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

08:41.250 --> 08:43.650
<b>Hey, you sure we don't need
to lend a hand?</b>

08:43.650 --> 08:45.890
<b>These guys are Kougaiji's
assassins, right?</b>

08:45.890 --> 08:48.820
<b>Yes, but it seems they have
their hands full right now</b>

08:48.820 --> 08:51.450
<b>with that uninvited guest of theirs.</b>

08:55.900 --> 08:57.360
<b>Let's go.</b>

09:02.440 --> 09:05.570
<b>We've found them! It's Genjo Sanzo!</b>

09:05.570 --> 09:07.080
<b>Kill them!
It seems they've driven a long way,
just to find us.</b>

09:07.080 --> 09:10.110
<b>It seems they've driven a long way,
just to find us.</b>

09:10.110 --> 09:13.640
<b>But that truck doesn't look like it runs.</b>

09:14.220 --> 09:17.980
<b>It probably broke down somewhere,
so they pushed it all this way.</b>

09:18.850 --> 09:21.120
<b>Good grief, they sure went
to a lot of trouble.</b>

09:21.120 --> 09:24.150
<b>Well, guess we'll get a light
after-dinner workout!</b>

09:25.090 --> 09:26.860
<b>What a pain in the butt.</b>

09:26.860 --> 09:29.190
<b>You'll gain weight if you
don't exercise a little.</b>

09:41.910 --> 09:43.110
<b>Small fry.</b>

09:43.110 --> 09:47.140
<b>I hope you haven't forgotten
our real objective, Zenon.</b>

09:48.580 --> 09:50.280
<b>I haven't forgotten.</b>

09:51.390 --> 09:55.890
<b>But, Shien, he's the one who's gonna
fight them in the end, right?</b>

09:55.890 --> 09:57.360
<b>However...</b>

10:21.250 --> 10:22.720
<b>Foolishness.</b>

10:29.890 --> 10:31.360
<b>Get them!</b>

10:40.670 --> 10:42.100
<b>What's that?</b>

11:05.230 --> 11:06.690
<b>Here he is.</b>

11:16.800 --> 11:18.640
<b>I've waited for this day.</b>

11:23.880 --> 11:27.370
<b>We finally meet again, Konzen.</b>

11:34.190 --> 11:37.020
<b>We finally meet again, Konzen.</b>

11:47.440 --> 11:50.030
<b>Have you lost all your memories
of the Heavens?</b>

11:51.340 --> 11:52.810
<b>Konzen?</b>

11:58.110 --> 12:04.220
<b>Konzen? When Sanzo was stabbed by
Rikudo in his attempt to save Goku,</b>

12:04.220 --> 12:06.590
<b>Goku's golden coronet was broken,</b>

12:06.590 --> 12:10.420
<b>and we were powerless
to stop his rampaging.</b>

12:11.630 --> 12:16.120
<b>That was when the Merciful
Goddess appeared.</b>

12:18.030 --> 12:19.500
<b>Yo!</b>

12:21.670 --> 12:25.570
<b>I bet you'll hate having this done
to you, Konzen Douji.</b>

12:25.570 --> 12:28.270
<b>No, you're Genjo Sanzo now,
aren't you?</b>

12:30.710 --> 12:32.210
<b>That time,</b>

12:32.210 --> 12:38.080
<b>the Merciful Goddess definitely
called Sanzo, Konzen Douji.</b>

12:41.890 --> 12:45.920
<b>His right eye's the same as mine.</b>

12:48.460 --> 12:51.030
<b>Yes, from ancient times,</b>

12:51.030 --> 12:55.100
<b>those with golden eyes are said
to be the source of fortune.</b>

12:55.100 --> 13:00.970
<b>In other words, we're beings of heresy,
both you and I, Son Goku.</b>

13:02.680 --> 13:06.480
<b>You're spouting a whole bunch
of nonsense,</b>

13:06.480 --> 13:08.720
<b>but who the heck are you?</b>

13:08.720 --> 13:11.890
<b>My name's Homura,
War Prince Homura.</b>

13:11.890 --> 13:13.390
<b>War Prince?</b>

13:13.390 --> 13:18.590
<b>To think even you have forgotten me,
General Kenren.</b>

13:18.590 --> 13:20.330
<b>Kenren?!</b>

13:20.330 --> 13:25.000
<b>Are you related to the
Merciful Goddess?</b>

13:25.000 --> 13:26.500
<b>Well, well.</b>

13:26.500 --> 13:32.030
<b>So, you do remember the Merciful
Goddess, Field Marshal Tenpou.</b>

13:35.380 --> 13:39.010
<b>Homura, quit babbling already!</b>

13:39.010 --> 13:41.520
<b>Hurry up and get to the main issue!</b>

13:41.520 --> 13:43.180
<b>Yes, why not?</b>

13:43.180 --> 13:44.620
<b>Main issue?</b>

13:44.620 --> 13:49.920
<b>Konzen, the Maten Scripture
you have there,</b>

13:49.920 --> 13:51.590
<b>you will hand it over to me.</b>

13:53.130 --> 13:54.430
<b>I refuse.</b>

13:54.430 --> 13:56.430
<b>You'll die for that.</b>

13:56.430 --> 13:57.900
<b>You just try it.</b>

13:59.330 --> 14:01.360
<b>I thought you'd say that.</b>

14:13.310 --> 14:14.280
<b>He's fast.</b>

14:14.280 --> 14:14.820
<b>Sanzo!
He's fast.</b>

14:14.820 --> 14:15.710
<b>Sanzo!</b>

14:18.820 --> 14:20.660
<b>There's no need to interfere.</b>

14:20.660 --> 14:24.280
<b>What's with this guy? I didn't feel
his presence at all.</b>

14:25.960 --> 14:27.430
<b>Same thing goes for you guys.</b>

14:29.960 --> 14:32.630
<b>What the hell do you intend to do
with the Maten Scripture?!</b>

14:33.570 --> 14:35.670
<b>I'm gonna wreck them,</b>

14:35.670 --> 14:38.660
<b>the Heavens, where those
incompetent fools reside.</b>

14:39.240 --> 14:40.710
<b>Not interested!</b>

14:49.680 --> 14:50.380
<b>What?!</b>

14:50.380 --> 14:51.190
<b>You think a gun like that will have
any effect on me?
What?!</b>

14:51.190 --> 14:52.850
<b>You think a gun like that will have
any effect on me?</b>

14:53.790 --> 14:54.920
<b>What did you say?!</b>

14:54.920 --> 14:58.260
<b>You won't be able to inflict even
a scratch on me, a god.</b>

14:58.890 --> 15:01.500
<b>Do you want to try again?</b>

15:01.500 --> 15:02.930
<b>My heart's right here.</b>

15:06.870 --> 15:09.500
<b>What's wrong? Aren't you
going to shoot?</b>

15:09.500 --> 15:12.340
<b>Zenon! Shoot me.</b>

15:16.040 --> 15:17.510
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

15:19.810 --> 15:22.480
<b>He won't stand a chance if he's shot
with a gun like that.</b>

15:29.120 --> 15:32.620
<b>Do you see? Gods can't be killed.</b>

15:34.630 --> 15:37.330
<b>Showing us we have no means
of defeating you</b>

15:37.330 --> 15:39.870
<b>and then demanding we hand over
the Scripture peacefully...</b>

15:39.870 --> 15:42.540
<b>How very kind of these so-called gods.</b>

15:42.540 --> 15:44.470
<b>If you understand, then throw
yourself at my feet</b>

15:44.470 --> 15:46.410
<b>and hand over the Scripture.</b>

15:47.240 --> 15:48.710
<b>Like hell I will!</b>

15:52.050 --> 15:53.180
<b>Damn it!</b>

15:53.180 --> 15:55.620
<b>Trusting only your heart,</b>

15:55.620 --> 15:57.720
<b>trusting only your eyes,</b>

15:57.720 --> 15:59.810
<b>and trusting only your strength...</b>

16:01.490 --> 16:04.420
<b>That's the one thing in you guys
I can sympathize with.</b>

16:05.360 --> 16:07.950
<b>But how is it with you guys now?</b>

16:08.700 --> 16:10.230
<b>Can you really say you're
standing there</b>

16:10.230 --> 16:12.630
<b>because of your strength
and yours alone?</b>

16:15.070 --> 16:19.770
<b>You won't be able to defeat me.
Hand over the Scripture!</b>

16:19.770 --> 16:23.040
<b>Don't make me repeat myself! I refuse!</b>

16:23.040 --> 16:24.510
<b>Then I won't speak of it anymore.</b>

16:25.210 --> 16:27.480
<b>I'll come at you in earnest this time.</b>

16:28.350 --> 16:29.850
<b>Are you ready?!</b>

16:29.850 --> 16:31.320
<b>Sanzo!</b>

16:40.730 --> 16:42.160
<b>Goku!</b>

16:43.500 --> 16:44.600
<b>Goku!</b>

16:44.600 --> 16:45.000
<b>Goku!
Goku!</b>

16:45.000 --> 16:46.100
<b>Goku!</b>

16:46.100 --> 16:49.400
<b>That boy, the way he's moving is
completely different from before.</b>

16:50.140 --> 16:53.510
<b>Why the hell do you guys
want the Scripture?!</b>

16:53.510 --> 16:54.410
<b>Move!</b>

16:54.410 --> 16:55.010
<b>I'm not moving!
Move!</b>

16:55.010 --> 16:56.040
<b>I'm not moving!</b>

16:56.040 --> 16:59.110
<b>Innocent eyes, pure intentions...</b>

16:59.110 --> 17:02.750
<b>But this boy's also a heresy,
abhorred as an abomination.</b>

17:02.750 --> 17:05.340
<b>Seiten Taisei, Son Goku.</b>

17:09.360 --> 17:14.330
<b>But at your level, you still
can't fulfill my wish.</b>

17:14.330 --> 17:15.920
<b>What's with that?</b>

17:16.730 --> 17:18.730
<b>What could he mean by that?</b>

17:18.730 --> 17:20.030
<b>Who knows?</b>

17:20.030 --> 17:21.500
<b>You'll find out soon enough.</b>

17:26.440 --> 17:27.910
<b>What the heck is that?</b>

17:29.340 --> 17:30.870
<b>Here comes the tour group.</b>

17:31.450 --> 17:32.910
<b>Again?!</b>

17:33.650 --> 17:35.710
<b>They sure sent a lot.</b>

17:39.090 --> 17:41.220
<b>There he is! It's Genjo Sanzo!</b>

17:41.220 --> 17:42.690
<b>Kill him!</b>

17:43.360 --> 17:44.820
<b>Worthless scum.</b>

18:00.110 --> 18:02.600
<b>All those demons in
the blink of an eye?</b>

18:03.440 --> 18:05.240
<b>He erased them all.</b>

18:09.350 --> 18:11.420
<b>Zenon, Shien!</b>

18:11.420 --> 18:12.850
<b>Yes?</b>

18:14.290 --> 18:15.760
<b>Let's go.</b>

18:16.790 --> 18:18.260
<b>We'll withdraw for the day!</b>

18:20.530 --> 18:22.000
<b>Understood.</b>

18:24.400 --> 18:26.000
<b>See ya around.</b>

18:26.000 --> 18:27.470
<b>Hey, wait.</b>

18:28.800 --> 18:30.270
<b>Lend me a light.</b>

18:31.210 --> 18:32.970
<b>You can have it.</b>

18:32.970 --> 18:36.170
<b>It's a gift from a god. You better
take good care of it.</b>

18:39.750 --> 18:41.240
<b>No thanks.</b>

18:50.690 --> 18:52.160
<b>Be seeing you.</b>

18:59.630 --> 19:01.100
<b>Those guys...</b>

19:11.810 --> 19:13.850
<b>Hey, how come you've got a lit one?!</b>

19:13.850 --> 19:16.050
<b>Where's the lighter?!</b>

19:16.050 --> 19:18.820
<b>I took the flint from your lighter.</b>

19:18.820 --> 19:21.290
<b>If you can't even use your head
for something like this,</b>

19:21.290 --> 19:23.360
<b>you're no better than that monkey
from some place.</b>

19:23.360 --> 19:25.760
<b>Bastard, taking my lighter
without my permission.</b>

19:25.760 --> 19:27.800
<b>Hey, hey, what monkey
from some place?</b>

19:27.800 --> 19:29.430
<b>Was there a monkey somewhere?</b>

19:29.430 --> 19:31.130
<b>He meant you, you stupid monkey.</b>

19:31.130 --> 19:33.230
<b>Who're you calling a monkey,
you red roach?!</b>

19:33.230 --> 19:36.170
<b>Bastard! I told you never
to call me that again!</b>

19:36.170 --> 19:36.840
<b>You stupid, minimum monkey!</b>

19:36.840 --> 19:37.740
<b>Idiots.
You stupid, minimum monkey!</b>

19:37.740 --> 19:38.340
<b>Idiots.
What's with that stupid minimum crap?!</b>

19:38.340 --> 19:39.110
<b>What's with that stupid minimum crap?!</b>

19:39.110 --> 19:40.470
<b>Sanzo...
What's with that stupid minimum crap?!</b>

19:40.470 --> 19:42.880
<b>Shut up, I don't want to hear it.
Knock it off, you roach water sprite!</b>

19:42.880 --> 19:43.480
<b>Knock it off, you roach water sprite!</b>

19:43.480 --> 19:45.180
<b>Is that all you can ever say?!</b>

19:45.180 --> 19:45.450
<b>Yes, Sir.
Is that all you can ever say?!</b>

19:45.450 --> 19:46.640
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

19:59.590 --> 20:02.330
<b>You sure it was okay to let them go?</b>

20:02.330 --> 20:06.370
<b>It shouldn't matter. We can
obtain the other one first.</b>

20:06.370 --> 20:07.830
<b>Is that not right, Homura?</b>

20:08.770 --> 20:10.440
<b>For the time being.</b>

20:10.440 --> 20:14.700
<b>But I'll get Konzen's Maten
Scripture as well.</b>

20:15.480 --> 20:18.470
<b>And that infinitely powerful strength.</b>

20:19.180 --> 20:21.520
<b>What the hell?! You just try it!
Pervy water sprite! Stupid water sprite!</b>

20:21.520 --> 20:24.650
<b>What the hell?! You just try it!
Pervy water sprite! Dumb water sprite!</b>

20:24.650 --> 20:28.660
<b>Konzen, the next time we meet
will be the end of you.</b>

20:28.660 --> 20:31.130
<b>I will allow no one to get in my way.</b>

20:31.130 --> 20:33.790
<b>Son Goku, not even you.</b>

20:33.790 --> 20:36.460
<b>Shut up! I'm gonna kill you guys!</b>

20:45.540 --> 20:54.350
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:55.720 --> 21:06.120
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:07.460 --> 21:17.600
<b>Emotions like the sand
spilling out of my hands</b>

21:18.940 --> 21:31.920
<b>The words that pierced my heart
back then suddenly ache</b>

21:31.920 --> 21:43.360
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:43.360 --> 21:54.640
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

21:54.640 --> 22:06.820
<b>Now, I can surely walk
on and on forever</b>
